   * 'innodb_log_spin_cpu_pct_hwm': Maximum amount of CPU usage above
     which user threads no longer spin while waiting for flushed redo.
     Added in MySQL 8.0.11.

   * 'innodb_log_wait_for_flush_spin_hwm': Maximum average log flush
     time beyond which user threads no longer spin while waiting for
