   * 'innodb_log_writer_threads': Enables dedicated log writer threads
     for writing and flushing redo logs.  Added in MySQL 8.0.22.

   * 'innodb_parallel_read_threads': Number of threads for parallel
     index reads.  Added in MySQL 8.0.14.

   * 'innodb_print_ddl_logs': Whether or not to print DDL logs to error
     log.  Added in MySQL 8.0.3.

   * 'innodb_redo_log_archive_dirs': Labeled redo log archive
