     Records:            306688  M.recordlength:       25  Packed:            83%
     Recordspace used:       97% Empty space:           2% Blocks/Record:   1.00
     Record blocks:      306688  Delete blocks:         0
     Record data:       7934464  Deleted data:          0
     Lost space:         256512  Linkdata:        1156096

