   * '--defaults-group-suffix=STR'

     Command-Line Format

     '--defaults-group-suffix=str'

     Type

     String

     Read not only the usual option groups, but also groups with the
     usual names and a suffix of STR.  For example, *note 'mysqlbinlog':
