     This variable controls the time zone of timestamps in messages
     written to the error log, and in general query log and slow query
     log messages written to files.  It does not affect the time zone of
     general query log and slow query log messages written to tables
     ('mysql.general_log', 'mysql.slow_log').  Rows retrieved from those
     tables can be converted from the local system time zone to any
     desired time zone with 'CONVERT_TZ()' or by setting the session
     'time_zone' system variable.

     Permitted 'log_timestamps' values are 'UTC' (the default) and
