     '0'

     Minimum Value

     '0'

     Maximum Value

     '1'

     This variable controls which algorithm the thread pool plugin uses:

        * '0': Use a conservative low-concurrency algorithm.

        * '1': Use an aggressive high-currency algorithm which performs
          better with optimal thread counts, but performance may be
          degraded if the number of connections reaches extremely high
