     level for all subsequent sessions.  Existing sessions are
     unaffected.

     To set the session or next-level 'transaction_isolation' value, use
     the *note 'SET': set-variable. statement.  For most session system
     variables, these statements are equivalent ways to set the value:

          SET @@SESSION.VAR_NAME = VALUE;
          SET SESSION VAR_NAME = VALUE;
          SET VAR_NAME = VALUE;
          SET @@VAR_NAME = VALUE;

