     include a nonzero 'MAX_EXECUTION_TIME' optimizer hint, and
     statements that include no such hint but execute while the timeout
     indicated by the 'max_execution_time' system variable is nonzero.

   * 'Max_execution_time_set_failed'

     The number of *note 'SELECT': select. statements for which the
     attempt to set an execution timeout failed.

   * 'Max_used_connections'

