7.4.2.4 Types of Error Log Filtering
....................................

Error log configuration normally includes one log filter component and
one or more log sink components.  For error log filtering, MySQL offers
a choice of components:

   * 'log_filter_internal': This filter component provides error log
     filtering based on log event priority and error code, in
     combination with the 'log_error_verbosity' and
     'log_error_suppression_list' system variables.
     'log_filter_internal' is built in and enabled by default.  See
     *note error-log-priority-based-filtering::.

   * 'log_filter_dragnet': This filter component provides error log
     filtering based on user-supplied rules, in combination with the
     'dragnet.log_error_filter_rules' system variable.  See *note
     error-log-rule-based-filtering::.


