regulatory compliance solution.  Security standards such as PCI, FIPS,
and others require use of key management systems to secure, manage, and
protect encryption keys in key vaults or hardware security modules
(HSMs).

To use 'component_keyring_encrypted_file' for keystore management in the
most common scenario, create two files: a manifest file that tells the
server to load 'component_keyring_encrypted_file', and a configuration
