       "password": "PASSWORD",
       "read_only": false
     }

After adding the two files, restart *note 'mysqld': mysqld.  Verify
component installation by examining the Performance Schema *note
'keyring_component_status':
performance-schema-keyring-component-status-table. table:

     mysql> SELECT * FROM performance_schema.keyring_component_status;

A 'Component_status' value of 'Active' indicates that the component
initialized successfully.

If the server startup fails or the 'Component_status' value is
'Disabled', check the server error log.

For more details and to review other scenarios, see *note
keyring-component-installation:: and *note
keyring-encrypted-file-component-configuration-notes::.

   * *note keyring-encrypted-file-component-configuration-notes::

   * *note keyring-encrypted-file-component-usage::

