8.5.3 MySQL Enterprise Data Masking and De-Identification Plugin
----------------------------------------------------------------

* Menu:

* data-masking-plugin-installation::  MySQL Enterprise Data Masking and De-Identification Plugin Installation
* data-masking-plugin-usage::    Using the MySQL Enterprise Data Masking and De-Identification Plugin
* data-masking-plugin-function-reference::  MySQL Enterprise Data Masking and De-Identification Plugin Function Reference
* data-masking-plugin-functions::  MySQL Enterprise Data Masking and De-Identification Plugin Function Descriptions

MySQL Enterprise Data Masking and De-Identification is based on a plugin
library that implements these elements:

   * A server-side plugin named 'data_masking'.

   * A set of loadable functions provides an SQL-level API for
     performing masking and de-identification operations.  Some of these
     functions require the 'SUPER' privilege.


