The MySQL optimizer includes the capability to perform tracing; the
interface is provided by a set of 'optimizer_trace_xxx' system variables
and the *note 'INFORMATION_SCHEMA.OPTIMIZER_TRACE':
information-schema-optimizer-trace-table. table.


