10.15.6 Privilege Checking
--------------------------

In complex scenarios where the query uses SQL SECURITY DEFINER views or
stored routines, it may be that a user is denied from seeing the trace
of its query because it lacks some extra privileges on those objects.
In that case, the trace will be shown as empty and the
INSUFFICIENT_PRIVILEGES column will show "1".


