10.15.14 Preventing the Use of Optimizer Trace
----------------------------------------------

If, for some reason, you wish to prevent users from seeing traces of
their queries, start the server with the options shown here:

     --maximum-optimizer-trace-max-mem-size=0 --optimizer-trace-max-mem-size=0

This sets the maximum size to 0 and prevents users from changing this
limit, thus truncating all traces to 0 bytes.


