format, using the 'JSON_PRETTY()' function.  You can see how much
storage space a given JSON value takes up, and how much space remains
for additional storage, using 'JSON_STORAGE_SIZE()' and
'JSON_STORAGE_FREE()', respectively.  For complete descriptions of these
functions, see *note json-utility-functions::.


