15.1.14 CREATE FUNCTION Statement
---------------------------------

The *note 'CREATE FUNCTION': create-function. statement is used to
create stored functions and loadable functions:

   * For information about creating stored functions, see *note
     create-procedure::.

   * For information about creating loadable functions, see *note
     create-function-loadable::.


