15.4.2.9 STOP SLAVE Statement
.............................

     STOP {SLAVE | REPLICA} [THREAD_TYPES] [CHANNEL_OPTION]

     THREAD_TYPES:
         [THREAD_TYPE [, THREAD_TYPE] ... ]

     THREAD_TYPE: IO_THREAD | SQL_THREAD

     CHANNEL_OPTION:
