     innodb-analyze-table-complexity::.

     'innodb_stats_persistent_sample_pages' only applies when
     'innodb_stats_persistent' is enabled for a table; when
     'innodb_stats_persistent' is disabled,
     'innodb_stats_transient_sample_pages' applies instead.

