  5. Query the 'innodb_memcache.containers' table to view the record you
     inserted earlier for the 'multicol' table.  The first record is the
     sample entry for the 'demo_test' table that is created during the
     initial 'daemon_memcached' plugin setup.  The second record is the
     entry you inserted for the 'multicol' table.

          mysql> SELECT * FROM innodb_memcache.containers\G
          *************************** 1. row ***************************
                            name: aaa
                       db_schema: test
                        db_table: demo_test
