  6. Query the 'multicol' table to view data inserted by the sample
     Python application.  The data is available for MySQL queries, which
     demonstrates how the same data can be accessed using SQL or through
     applications (using the appropriate *note MySQL Connector or API:
     connectors-apis.).

          mysql> SELECT * FROM test.multicol;
