     The number of replica acknowledgments the source must receive per
     transaction before proceeding.  By default
     'rpl_semi_sync_master_wait_for_slave_count' is '1', meaning that
     semisynchronous replication proceeds after receiving a single
     replica acknowledgment.  Performance is best for small values of
     this variable.

