     From MySQL 8.0.26, use 'replica_sql_verify_checksum' in place of
     'slave_sql_verify_checksum', which is deprecated from that release.
     In releases before MySQL 8.0.26, use 'slave_sql_verify_checksum'.

     'slave_sql_verify_checksum' causes the replication SQL (applier)
