     'slave_net_timeout' specifies the number of seconds to wait for
     more data or a heartbeat signal from the source before the replica
     considers the connection broken, aborts the read, and tries to
     reconnect.  Setting this variable has no immediate effect.  The
     state of the variable applies on all subsequent *note 'START
