     Holds the base name and path for the binary log files, which can be
     set with the '--log-bin' server option.  The maximum variable
     length is 256.  In MySQL 8.0, if the '--log-bin' option is not
     supplied, the default base name is 'binlog'.  For compatibility
     with MySQL 5.7, if the '--log-bin' option is supplied with no
     string or with an empty string, the default base name is
     'HOST_NAME-bin', using the name of the host machine.  The default
     location is the data directory.

