19.5.1.4 Replication and CHECKSUM TABLE
.......................................

*note 'CHECKSUM TABLE': checksum-table. returns a checksum that is
calculated row by row, using a method that depends on the table row
storage format.  The storage format is not guaranteed to remain the same
between MySQL versions, so the checksum value might change following an
upgrade.


