19.5.1.5 Replication of CREATE SERVER, ALTER SERVER, and DROP SERVER
....................................................................

The statements *note 'CREATE SERVER': create-server, *note 'ALTER
SERVER': alter-server, and *note 'DROP SERVER': drop-server. are not
written to the binary log, regardless of the binary logging format that
is in use.


