19.5.1.17 Replication and Fractional Seconds Support
....................................................

MySQL 8.0 permits fractional seconds for *note 'TIME': time, *note
'DATETIME': datetime, and *note 'TIMESTAMP': datetime. values, with up
to microseconds (6 digits) precision.  See *note fractional-seconds::.


