20.6 Group Replication Security
===============================

* Menu:

* group-replication-connection-security::  Communication Stack for Connection Security Management
* group-replication-secure-socket-layer-support-ssl::  Securing Group Communication Connections with Secure Socket Layer (SSL)
* group-replication-distributed-recovery-securing::  Securing Distributed Recovery Connections
* group-replication-ip-address-permissions::  Group Replication IP Address Permissions

This section explains how to secure a group, securing the connections
between members of a group, or by establishing a security perimeter
using an IP address allowlist.


