20.8.3 Group Replication Online Upgrade
---------------------------------------

* Menu:

* group-replication-online-upgrade-considerations::  Online Upgrade Considerations
* group-replication-upgrading-member::  Upgrading a Group Replication Member
* group-replication-online-upgrade-methods::  Group Replication Online Upgrade Methods
* group-replication-upgrade-with-mysqlbackup::  Group Replication Upgrade with mysqlbackup

When you have a group running which you want to upgrade but you need to
keep the group online to serve your application, you need to consider
your approach to the upgrade.  This section describes the different
elements involved in an online upgrade, and various methods of how to
upgrade your group.


