20.8.3.1 Online Upgrade Considerations
......................................

When upgrading an online group you should consider the following points:

   * Regardless of the way which you upgrade your group, it is important
     to disable any writes to group members until they are ready to
     rejoin the group.

   * When a member is stopped, the 'super_read_only' variable is set to
     on automatically, but this change is not persisted.

   * When MySQL 5.7.22 or MySQL 8.0.11 tries to join a group running
     MySQL 5.7.21 or lower it fails to join the group because MySQL
     5.7.21 does not send its value of 'lower_case_table_names'.


