     The value of this system variable can be changed while Group
     Replication is running, but the change takes effect only after you
     stop and restart Group Replication on the group member.

     'group_replication_recovery_complete_at' specifies the policy
     applied during the distributed recovery process when handling
     cached transactions after state transfer from an existing member.
