     stop and restart Group Replication on the group member.

     'group_replication_recovery_public_key_path' specifies the path
     name to a file containing a replica-side copy of the public key
     required by the source for RSA key pair-based password exchange.
     The file must be in PEM format.  If
     'group_replication_recovery_public_key_path' is set to a valid
