        * The values 'ADD_TABLE_MASTER' and 'ADD_TABLE_SLAVE' previously
          shown in the 'tab_copy_status' column of the 'ndbinfo' *note
          'ndbinfo.table_distribution_status':
          mysql-cluster-ndbinfo-table-distribution-status. table are
          deprecated.  These are replaced by, respectively, the values
