   * '--ndb-transid-mysql-connection-map=STATE'

     Command-Line Format

     '--ndb-transid-mysql-connection-map[=state]'

     Type

     Enumeration

     Default Value

     'ON'

     Valid Values

     'ON' 'OFF' 'FORCE'

     Enables or disables the plugin that handles the *note
     'ndb_transid_mysql_connection_map':
     information-schema-ndb-transid-mysql-connection-map-table. table in
     the 'INFORMATION_SCHEMA' database.  Takes one of the values 'ON',
