     plugin fails to load and start.

     You can see whether the *note 'ndb_transid_mysql_connection_map':
     information-schema-ndb-transid-mysql-connection-map-table. table
     plugin is running by checking the output of *note 'SHOW PLUGINS':
     show-plugins.

   * '--ndb-wait-connected=SECONDS'

     Command-Line Format

     '--ndb-wait-connected=#'

     System Variable

     'ndb_wait_connected'

