     'Ndb_metadata_blacklist_size'.

   * 'Ndb_metadata_synced_count'

     The number of NDB metadata objects which have been synchronized on
     this SQL node since it was last restarted.

   * 'Ndb_number_of_data_nodes'

     If the server is part of an NDB Cluster, the value of this variable
