25.5.23.1 Restoring an NDB Backup to a Different Version of NDB Cluster
.......................................................................

* Menu:

* ndb-restore-to-previous-version::  Restoring an NDB backup to a previous version of NDB Cluster
* ndb-restore-to-later-version::  Restoring an NDB backup to a later version of NDB Cluster

The following two sections provide information about restoring a native
NDB backup to a different version of NDB Cluster from the version in
which the backup was taken.

In addition, you should consult *note mysql-cluster-upgrade-downgrade::,
for other issues you may encounter when attempting to restore an NDB
backup to a cluster running a different version of the NDB software.

It is also advisable to review *note mysql-cluster-what-is-new-8-0::, as
well as *note upgrading-from-previous-series::, for other changes
between NDB 8.0 and previous versions of NDB Cluster that may be
relevant to your particular circumstances.


