     The name of the catalog to which the view belongs.  This value is
     always 'def'.

   * 'VIEW_SCHEMA'

     The name of the schema (database) to which the view belongs.

   * 'VIEW_NAME'

     The name of the view.

   * 'TABLE_CATALOG'

     The name of the catalog to which the table or view used in the view
     definition belongs.  This value is always 'def'.

   * 'TABLE_SCHEMA'

     The name of the schema (database) to which the table or view used
     in the view definition belongs.

   * 'TABLE_NAME'

     The name of the table or view used in the view definition.


