28.4.16 The INFORMATION_SCHEMA INNODB_FT_DEFAULT_STOPWORD Table
---------------------------------------------------------------

The *note 'INNODB_FT_DEFAULT_STOPWORD':
information-schema-innodb-ft-default-stopword-table. table holds a list
of stopwords that are used by default when creating a 'FULLTEXT' index
