30.4.4.5 The ps_setup_disable_consumer() Procedure
..................................................

Disables Performance Schema consumers with names that contain the
argument.  Produces a result set indicating how many consumers were
disabled.  Already disabled consumers do not count.

*Parameters*

   * 'consumer VARCHAR(128)': The value used to match consumer names,
     which are identified by using '%consumer%' as an operand for a
     'LIKE' pattern match.

     A value of '''' matches all consumers.

*Example*

