     tmpdir
     slave_load_tmpdir or replica_load_tmpdir
     innodb_data_home_dir
     innodb_log_group_home_dir
     innodb_undo_directory
     basedir

A value that matches the value of system variable SYSVAR is replaced
with the string '@@GLOBAL.SYSVAR'.

